; =====================================================================
; Geo_Prep_zup_pk2.dat -- Z-UP frame, joist pockets at the TEST heights, two leaves only around the pockets (29 Oct 2026).
; FRAME: X in-plane, Y out-of-plane (+Y towards the joists), Z up (Geo_Prep_zup.dat; X = 1.292 - x of the old frame).
; POCKET HEIGHTS (Moshfeghi et al. 2024, Fig. 5: joist tops 425 mm and 2280 mm above the masonry base), moved one
;   course each onto existing bed joints, joist depth kept at three courses (175.9 mm, real section not confirmed):
;     lower pocket  Z 0.23455 - 0.41045   (was 0.29318 - 0.46909)
;     upper pocket  Z 2.11091 - 2.28682   (was 2.05227 - 2.22818)
;   plan position and depth as before: X 0.3230-0.4037 and 0.8882-0.9690, Y 0.105-0.210 (joist half).
; CUT AT Y = 0.105 ONLY AROUND THE POCKETS (two leaves locally, one-brick wall elsewhere). Geo_Prep.dat split the
;   two stretcher courses of each pocket band across the WHOLE wall, a collar joint the one-brick wall does not
;   have. Here the split is a one-brick ring around each pocket: every brick that touches the pocket void --
;   the bricks the pocket cuts into, the header bricks whose end meets a pocket face, and the bricks of the
;   course directly above the ceiling and below the floor -- 34 bricks, selected course by course (header and
;   stretcher courses are offset). Two-leaf extent per course: stretcher courses X 0.269-0.484 and 0.700-1.131,
;   header courses X 0.215-0.431 and 0.861-1.077; five courses per floor (Z 0.176-0.469 and 2.052-2.346).
;   Checked offline on the brick boxes (centroid range semantics): 34 split, none missed, none extra; pocket
;   voids exact (0.005966 m3); no full-thickness piece touches a pocket; no split at the wall ends.
; Output: GEO_WALL_zup_pk2.sav. Build with ANALYSIS_PART_I_MASON_zup_pk2.dat.
; =====================================================================
model new
model config dynamic
model dynamic active off
model large-strain off

call 'Groningen_zup.dec'

;SUPPORT BLOCK
block create brick 0 1.292 0.0 0.210 -0.05 0 group 'S'

;TOP BEAM
block create brick 0 1.292 0.0 0.210 2.58 2.68 group 'T_B'

; ---- split at Y = 0.105: the bricks around each pocket (one-brick ring, see the header) ----------------
; ---- stretcher courses [3, 5, 7, 35, 37, 39] (Z bottoms 0.1759, 0.2932, 0.4105, 2.0524, 2.1697, 2.2870): 3 bricks per course, X windows 0.2961-0.4845, 0.6998-1.1170 ----
block hide
block hide off range pos-z 0.1876 0.2228
block hide off range pos-z 0.3049 0.3401
block hide off range pos-z 0.4222 0.4574
block hide off range pos-z 2.0641 2.0993
block hide off range pos-z 2.1814 2.2166
block hide off range pos-z 2.2987 2.3339
block hide range pos-x -1.0000 0.2961
block hide range pos-x 0.4845 0.6998
block hide range pos-x 1.1170 11.0000
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 0 origin 0 0.105 0

; ---- header courses [4, 6, 36, 38] (Z bottoms 0.2346, 0.3518, 2.1110, 2.2283): 4 bricks per course, X windows 0.2154-0.4306, 0.8614-1.0766 ----
block hide
block hide off range pos-z 0.2463 0.2815
block hide off range pos-z 0.3636 0.3988
block hide off range pos-z 2.1228 2.1580
block hide off range pos-z 2.2400 2.2752
block hide range pos-x -1.0000 0.2154
block hide range pos-x 0.4306 0.8614
block hide range pos-x 1.0766 11.0000
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 0 origin 0 0.105 0

; ---- remove the pocket volume: bands, joist half (Y > 0.105), between the pocket faces -------------------------
block hide off

block hide range pos-z -10000 0.2346
block hide range pos-z 0.4105 2.1109
block hide range pos-z 2.2869 100000

block hide range pos-y -1 0.105

block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.9690 0 0
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.8882 0 0
block delete range pos-x 0.8882 0.9690

block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.4037 0 0
block cut joint-set dip 90 dip-direction 90 origin 0.3230 0 0
block delete range pos-x 0.3230 0.4037

block hide off
block group "Masonry" range group "S" or "T_B" not
model save 'GEO_WALL_zup_pk2'
